#. The "Composing" section in the settings window
#: Text ID:Composing
msgid "Composing"
msgstr "Komposition"

#: Text ID:UseXorgRules
msgid "Use sequences from the Xorg project"
msgstr "Brug sekvenser fra Xorg-projektet"

#: Text ID:UseXorgRulesToolTip
msgid "Use the 3,000 compose sequences from the Xorg project (http://www.x.org/). These are the sequences most commonly found on a standard Linux system."
msgstr "Brug de 3.000 compose-sekvenser fra Xorg-projektet (http://www.x.org/). Det er de sekvenser, man oftest finder på et almindeligt Linux-system."

#: Text ID:UseXComposeRules
msgid "Use sequences from the XCompose project"
msgstr "Brug sekvenser fra XCompose-projektet"

#: Text ID:UseXComposeRulesToolTip
msgid "Use the 1,000 compose sequences from the XCompose opensource project (https://github.com/kragen/xcompose). These sequences may sometimes conflict with the Xorg ones."
msgstr "Brug de 1.000 compose-sekvenser fra open source-projektet XCompose (https://github.com/kragen/xcompose). Disse sekvenser kan somme tider være i konflikt med Xorg-sekvenserne."

#: Text ID:UseEmojiRules
msgid "Use WinCompose emoji sequences"
msgstr "Brug WinCompose-emojisekvenser"

#: Text ID:UseEmojiRulesToolTip
msgid "Use the compose sequences for Emoji provided by the WinCompose author and contributors."
msgstr "Brug de compose-sekvenser til emoji, som WinCompose-forfatteren og bidragyderne stiller til rådighed."

#. Menu entry to show the debug window
#: Text ID:DebugWindow
msgid "Debug Window"
msgstr "Fejlsøgningsvindue"

#. A button to visit the donation page (http://wincompose.info/donate/)
#: Text ID:DonationPage
msgid "Donation Page"
msgstr "Donationsside"

#. Name of the category (Unicode characters, Emoji, User macros, Favorites)
#: Text ID:UnicodeCharacters
msgid "Unicode characters"
msgstr "Unicode-tegn"

#: Text ID:SwapOnInvalid
msgid "Try to swap the two keys"
msgstr "Prøv at bytte om på de to taster"

#: Text ID:SwapOnInvalidToolTip
msgid "Try to swap the keys of a two-key sequence. For instance, if Compose E A is not a valid sequence, try Compose A E instead."
msgstr "Prøv at bytte om på tasterne i en sekvens med to taster. Hvis Compose E A for eksempel ikke er en gyldig sekvens, så prøv Compose A E i stedet."

#: Text ID:ComposeKeyToolTip
msgid "Select the key that should act as the Compose key."
msgstr "Vælg den tast, der skal fungere som Compose-tast."

#. The compose key deactivates itself after a certain configurable delay
#: Text ID:ResetTimeout
msgid "Reset timeout"
msgstr "Tidsgrænse for nulstilling"

#: Text ID:UnicodeInput
msgid "Advanced Unicode input"
msgstr "Avanceret Unicode-indtastning"

#: Text ID:UnicodeInputToolTip
msgid "Enable Unicode input for all characters, even those with no compose sequence defined. For instance, the following sequence will output character U+1A3F: Compose U 1 A 3 F Enter"
msgstr "Aktivér Unicode-indtastning for alle tegn, også dem uden en defineret compose-sekvens. For eksempel giver følgende sekvens tegnet U+1A3F: Compose U 1 A 3 F Enter"

#. This is the name of a category of settings about what happens when invalid sequences are typed
#: Text ID:InvalidSequences
msgid "On invalid sequences"
msgstr "Ved ugyldige sekvenser"

#: Text ID:CaseInsensitiveToolTip
msgid "If the entered sequence does not exist, but there is one that only differs by case, automatically correct it."
msgstr "Hvis den indtastede sekvens ikke findes, men der findes en, som kun adskiller sig ved store og små bogstaver, rettes den automatisk."

#: Text ID:DiscardOnInvalid
msgid "Discard all typed characters"
msgstr "Kassér alle indtastede tegn"

#: Text ID:DiscardOnInvalidToolTip
msgid "If the entered sequence does not exist, discard all the characters that were typed. The default behaviour is to output the characters as if the compose key had not been used."
msgstr "Hvis den indtastede sekvens ikke findes, kasseres alle de tegn, der blev tastet. Standardopførslen er at skrive tegnene, som om Compose-tasten ikke var brugt."

#: Text ID:BeepOnInvalid
msgid "Emit a beep"
msgstr "Afspil et bip"

#: Text ID:BeepOnInvalidToolTip
msgid "If the entered sequence does not exist, emit a system sound."
msgstr "Hvis den indtastede sekvens ikke findes, afspilles en systemlyd."

#: Text ID:LanguageToolTip
msgid "Select the language that WinCompose uses for the interface. By default the operating system language is used."
msgstr "Vælg det sprog, WinCompose bruger til brugerfladen. Som standard bruges operativsystemets sprog."

#. Copy character or symbol to the clipboard
#: Text ID:CopyToClipboard
msgid "Copy to clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiér til udklipsholder"

#. Name of the category (Unicode characters, Emoji, User macros, Favorites)
#: Text ID:Emoji
msgid "Emoji"
msgstr "Emoji"

#: Text ID:KeepOriginalKeyToolTip
msgid "This tells WinCompose to make a best effort to retain the original key’s behaviour. For instance, the Alt-Tab shortcut will still work even if Alt is used as the compose key."
msgstr "Dette beder WinCompose om efter bedste evne at bevare tastens oprindelige opførsel. For eksempel virker genvejen Alt-Tab stadig, selv om Alt bruges som Compose-tast."

#: Text ID:InsertZwspToolTip
msgid "Microsoft Office applications sometimes change the document font on the fly when entering certain Unicode characters. This feature inserts an invisible character after the Unicode character to work around the bug."
msgstr "Microsoft Office-programmer skifter somme tider dokumentets skrifttype undervejs, når man indtaster bestemte Unicode-tegn. Denne funktion indsætter et usynligt tegn efter Unicode-tegnet for at omgå fejlen."

#: Text ID:EmulateCapsLockToolTip
msgid "If Caps Lock is used as the compose key, the original behaviour of the key becomes unavailable. This feature allows to turn Caps Lock on by pressing both Shift keys simultaneously."
msgstr "Hvis Caps Lock bruges som Compose-tast, bliver tastens oprindelige opførsel utilgængelig. Denne funktion gør det muligt at slå Caps Lock til ved at trykke på begge Skift-taster samtidig."

#: Text ID:ShiftDisablesCapsLockToolTip
msgid "If Caps Lock is used as the compose key, the original behaviour of the key becomes unavailable. This feature allows to turn Caps Lock off by pressing the Shift key."
msgstr "Hvis Caps Lock bruges som Compose-tast, bliver tastens oprindelige opførsel utilgængelig. Denne funktion gør det muligt at slå Caps Lock fra ved at trykke på Skift-tasten."

#: Text ID:CapsLockCapitalizes
msgid "Caps Lock always capitalizes letters"
msgstr "Caps Lock skriver altid store bogstaver"

#: Text ID:CapsLockCapitalizesToolTip
msgid "When Caps Lock is on, typing an accented letter such as “é” will always output the corresponding capitalized letter, in this case “É”."
msgstr "Når Caps Lock er slået til, giver et accenttegn som “é” altid det tilsvarende store bogstav, i dette tilfælde “É”."

#. The “general” tab of the options window
#: Text ID:General
msgid "General"
msgstr "Generelt"

#: Text ID:Behavior
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Opførsel"

#. Format string to display the current reset delay
#: Text ID:DelaySeconds
msgid "{0} seconds"
msgstr "{0} sekunder"

#. Download new version menu entry. {0}: version number
#: Text ID:Download
msgid "Download WinCompose {0}"
msgstr "Hent WinCompose {0}"

#. The tab item to see all the program authors.
#: Text ID:Authors
msgid "Authors"
msgstr "Forfattere"

#. A button to report bugs (opens web browser)
#: Text ID:ReportBug
msgid "Report a Bug"
msgstr "Rapportér en fejl"

#. The context menu for about, help, and software updates
#: Text ID:Help
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Hjælp"

#. Message displayed in the notification area tooltip.
#: Text ID:UpdatesToolTip
msgid "Updates are available."
msgstr "Der er opdateringer tilgængelige."

#: Text ID:UserDefinedSequences
msgid "User-defined sequences"
msgstr "Brugerdefinerede sekvenser"

#. A button to open the file containing the user-defined sequences.
#: Text ID:UserDefinedSequencesEdit
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Redigér"

#. A button to reload the user-defined sequences.
#: Text ID:UserDefinedSequencesReload
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Genindlæs"

#: Text ID:AllowInjected
msgid "Allow Injected Keys"
msgstr "Tillad injicerede tastetryk"

#: Text ID:AllowInjectedToolTip
msgid "Do not ignore keys sent by other software like AutoHotkey or Synergy"
msgstr "Ignorér ikke tastetryk sendt af anden software som AutoHotkey eller Synergy"

#. The name of the “Print Screen” key on the keyboard
#: Text ID:KeyPrint
msgid "Prt Scrn"
msgstr "Prt Scrn"

#. String to show instead of the key name when no compose key is configured
#: Text ID:KeyDisabled
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Deaktiveret"

#: Text ID:CheckUpdates
msgid "Automatically check for updates"
msgstr "Søg automatisk efter opdateringer"

#: Text ID:CheckUpdatesToolTip
msgid "If enabled, WinCompose will connect to the Internet at regular intervals to check for new versions. Updates are not installed automatically."
msgstr "Hvis dette er slået til, forbinder WinCompose med jævne mellemrum til internettet for at se efter nye versioner. Opdateringer installeres ikke automatisk."

#: Text ID:KeepIconVisible
msgid "Try to keep notification area icon always visible"
msgstr "Forsøg altid at holde ikonet i meddelelsesområdet synligt"

#: Text ID:KeepIconVisibleToolTip
msgid "By default, Windows will remove the icon from the notification area after a short while. This option attempts to keep it always visible."
msgstr "Som standard fjerner Windows ikonet fra meddelelsesområdet efter kort tid. Denne indstilling forsøger at holde det synligt hele tiden."

#. The user can click on this button to change the current compose key.
#: Text ID:ChangeComposeKey
msgid "Change…"
msgstr "Ændr…"

#: Text ID:CaptureComposeKey
msgid "Please press a key to use as your compose key."
msgstr "Tryk på den tast, du vil bruge som Compose-tast."

#. Add sequence to the list of favorites.
#: Text ID:AddToFavorites
msgid "Add to favorites"
msgstr "Tilføj til favoritter"

#: Text ID:DisableIcon
msgid "Disable notification area icon"
msgstr "Deaktivér ikonet i meddelelsesområdet"

#: Text ID:DisableIconToolTip
msgid "If enabled, WinCompose will no longer display an icon in the notification area. The only way to open the WinCompose interface will then be through the “WinCompose Settings” and “WinCompose Sequences” entries in the startup menu."
msgstr "Hvis dette er slået til, viser WinCompose ikke længere et ikon i meddelelsesområdet. Den eneste måde at åbne WinCompose-brugerfladen på bliver da via punkterne “WinCompose Settings” og “WinCompose Sequences” i startmenuen."

#. The name of the “Home” key on the keyboard
#: Text ID:KeyHome
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Home"

#. The name of the “End” key on the keyboard
#: Text ID:KeyEnd
msgid "End"
msgstr "End"

#. The name of the “Tab” key on the keyboard
#: Text ID:KeyTab
msgid "Tab"
msgstr "Tab"

#. Text to show instead of a value in seconds when the reset timeout feature is disabled
#: Text ID:NoTimeout
msgid "No timeout"
msgstr "Ingen tidsgrænse"

#. The “Advanced” section in the settings.
#: Text ID:Advanced
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanceret"

#. “regex” is shorthand for “regular expression”.
#: Text ID:IgnoreRegex
msgid "Ignore windows matching this regex:"
msgstr "Ignorér vinduer, der matcher dette regulære udtryk:"

#: Text ID:IgnoreRegexToolTip
msgid "WinCompose will be completely disabled when the current window class or window name matches this regular expression."
msgstr "WinCompose deaktiveres helt, når det aktuelle vindues klasse eller navn matcher dette regulære udtryk."

#: Text ID:AlwaysCompose
msgid "Alternate compose key is always Compose"
msgstr "Alternativ Compose-tast er altid Compose"

#: Text ID:AlwaysComposeToolTip
msgid "If enabled, all compose keys will be treated as Compose in a sequence. By default, only the first pressed key will act as Compose, and alternate compose keys will keep their original role."
msgstr "Hvis dette er slået til, behandles alle Compose-taster som Compose i en sekvens. Som standard fungerer kun den først trykkede tast som Compose, og alternative Compose-taster beholder deres oprindelige rolle."

#. Remove sequence from the list of favorites.
#: Text ID:RemoveFromFavorites
msgid "Remove from favorites"
msgstr "Fjern fra favoritter"

#. Name of the category (Unicode characters, Emoji, User macros, Favorites)
#: Text ID:Favorites
msgid "Favorites"
msgstr "Favoritter"

#: Text ID:TimeoutToolTip
msgid "If set, any compose sequence will be cancelled after a certain delay if no keyboard activity is detected."
msgstr "Hvis dette er sat, annulleres enhver compose-sekvens efter en vis forsinkelse, hvis der ikke registreres tastaturaktivitet."

#: Text ID:KeyboardLed
msgid "Keyboard LED"
msgstr "Tastatur-LED"

#: Text ID:KeyboardLedToolTip
msgid "If set, the corresponding keyboard LED will be lit when a compose sequence is in progress."
msgstr "Hvis dette er sat, lyser den tilsvarende LED på tastaturet, mens en compose-sekvens er i gang."

#. The short name of the compose key
#: Text ID:KeyCompose
msgid "Compose"
msgstr "Compose"

#: Text ID:AutoLaunch
msgid "Launch WinCompose on login"
msgstr "Start WinCompose ved login"

#: Text ID:AutoLaunchToolTip
msgid "If set, WinCompose will be started when the user logs in."
msgstr "Hvis dette er sat, startes WinCompose, når brugeren logger ind."

#: Text ID:Accessibility
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Tilgængelighed"

#: Text ID:MustHoldCapsLock
msgid "Caps Lock is only active while being held down"
msgstr "Caps Lock er kun aktiv, mens tasten holdes nede"

#: Text ID:MustHoldCapsLockToolTip
msgid "Releasing the Caps Lock key will immediately disable it, instead of the more standard behaviour of having to press it a second time."
msgstr "Når Caps Lock-tasten slippes, slås den fra med det samme i stedet for den mere almindelige opførsel, hvor man skal trykke på den en gang til."

#: Text ID:RunElevated
msgid "Run with elevated privileges (recommended)"
msgstr "Kør med forhøjede rettigheder (anbefales)"

#: Text ID:RunElevatedToolTip
msgid "Composition will not work in some applications if WinCompose does not run with elevated privileges. This options reduces the chances that this will happen."
msgstr "Komposition virker ikke i visse programmer, hvis WinCompose ikke kører med forhøjede rettigheder. Denne indstilling mindsker risikoen for, at det sker."
